# Cloudflare Pages response headers.

# The benchmark headline summary gauntlet publishes every cycle (see the Headline
# type in the gauntlet repo). isotope13.ai reads it from the browser to keep its
# front-page numbers current without redeploying that site, so it needs CORS.
#
# Public data by definition — the compare page already publishes all of it, and
# battle.json carries every sample behind it — so any origin may read it.
#
# A cycle rewrites it roughly every eight hours; five minutes of caching keeps a
# quoted number close to live while keeping repeat views off the origin.
/assets/benchmark.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
